  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Just Leaders: Leadership for Social Justice in Higher Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Centre for Sexualities Aids and Gender identity at the University of Pretoria collaborate with five other univerisities in the region on student leadership and awareness of LGBTIQA+ issues. Strenghten student bodies, research and influencing policies for inclusive higher education. At the core of SAIHs work are the SDGs and the principle of leaving no-one behind. The programme focuses on groups that have historically been oppressed because they are indigenous, afro-descendants or other ethnic minorities, women, LGBTQIA+, live with disabilities, or come from lower socioeconomic backgrounds.</narrative>
  </description>
